<b>I miss you, Hananoi-kun</b>

14:09.350 --> 14:11.190
H-Hananoi-kun?

14:11.800 --> 14:13.960
<i>Ah! Hotaru-chan?</i>

14:15.470 --> 14:19.960
<i>Sorry to surprise you. 
I got your message.</i>

14:20.880 --> 14:23.100
O-Oh, yeah.

14:23.100 --> 14:26.870
<i>So, actually, right now...</i>

14:44.410 --> 14:47.060
Sorry. I'm here.

14:52.290 --> 14:53.480
Hotaru?

14:53.860 --> 14:55.680
Where are you going at this hour?

14:55.680 --> 14:56.870
Just the convenience store!

14:57.960 --> 14:59.320
Hananoi-kun!

15:19.600 --> 15:21.890
Oh! S-Sorry!

15:21.890 --> 15:24.730
I've been so Hotaru deprived, 
I wasn't thinking!

15:28.850 --> 15:31.930
Me too! I've missed you so much!

15:37.760 --> 15:38.840
So...

15:39.370 --> 15:42.300
I'm positive I like you, Hananoi-kun.

15:42.970 --> 15:47.300
But when you ask if I'm sure about it,

15:47.300 --> 15:51.420
I'm not sure I can keep up with 
you on all your sense of values.

15:51.420 --> 15:54.760
I'm not confident I'll be an ideal girlfriend.

15:54.760 --> 15:59.190
I mean, I don't have any reason 
whatsoever to be confident.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.380
But you know...

16:03.300 --> 16:07.770
Can't we still be together, 
even if we see things differently?

16:11.780 --> 16:18.190
The other day when we were baking 
together, I was so happy.

16:19.670 --> 16:21.480
But it wasn't just then.

16:22.080 --> 16:24.480
There have been so many occasions

16:24.480 --> 16:28.410
that were a delight.
Where I was thrilled to be with you,

16:29.280 --> 16:31.710
or even just to talk to you.

16:33.390 --> 16:38.190
I figure maybe, as those things keep 
adding up, I'll find my confidence.

16:41.450 --> 16:45.280
So, you know, I think this 
is just the beginning.

16:46.700 --> 16:48.920
I want it to be you, Hananoi-kun.

16:50.000 --> 16:54.040
Things may not always work,
 and I might cry sometimes,

16:54.040 --> 16:56.390
but you're who I want to share that with.

16:58.810 --> 17:03.250
So do you think you could go out
 with someone like me?

17:08.520 --> 17:12.600
That's what... I should be asking you.

17:13.340 --> 17:16.030
What? Why are you crying?

17:16.660 --> 17:17.970
I'm not crying.

17:17.970 --> 17:21.120
Oh, really? Sorry, my mistake.

17:26.700 --> 17:31.380
I'm sorry. I'm the one lacking confidence.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.850
<i>He really is crying.</i>

17:43.160 --> 17:44.290
I love you.

17:48.790 --> 17:50.960
Y-You flatter me.

17:54.490 --> 17:56.140
I'm looking forward to us.

17:56.560 --> 17:58.980
So... So am I!

18:04.150 --> 18:07.660
<i>D-Does this mean we're about to—</i>

18:31.540 --> 18:33.380
<i>It's winter. I'm sixteen.</i>

18:34.220 --> 18:38.690
<i>And starting today, we really 
are boyfriend and girlfriend.</i>

20:28.990 --> 20:31.940
<b>The Horse and the Witch</b>

20:31.050 --> 20:32.010
Hey there.

20:34.100 --> 20:37.120
All by yourself again, sonny?

20:42.090 --> 20:46.850
What's going on? You look 
even gloomier than normal.

20:47.750 --> 20:53.680
My mom and dad promised to 
come back to Japan next week,

20:53.680 --> 20:55.350
but now they can't.

20:55.940 --> 20:57.400
Is that right?

20:58.640 --> 21:03.620
Well, a doctor's life is 
always full of surprises.

21:03.610 --> 21:09.620
<b>The Horse and the Witch</b>

21:03.980 --> 21:09.300
I wonder if even they care about me at all.

21:11.890 --> 21:14.420
Well, I guess it's about time for you.

21:14.930 --> 21:19.750
Your parents are living as they please,
so you should live freely too.

21:20.650 --> 21:25.420
You gotta find someone else 
that you really love.

21:27.130 --> 21:29.880
More than Mom and Dad?

21:30.430 --> 21:32.930
Yeah! That's what they call...

21:33.700 --> 21:35.440
a soulmate!

21:37.950 --> 21:43.330
In my case, I lived a little <i>too</i> freely,
 so my folks cut ties with me.

21:43.970 --> 21:47.220
But when I met my wife,
it changed my universe.

21:48.700 --> 21:50.390
A soulmate?

21:51.140 --> 21:55.150
So, how about it?
Any girls you like at school?

21:55.150 --> 21:55.750
No.

21:57.230 --> 21:58.820
Get out there, sonny!

22:00.840 --> 22:06.490
You've got your whole life ahead of you.

22:44.360 --> 22:45.440
Early day tomorrow,
 so I'm headed to sleep!

22:44.360 --> 22:45.440
Night!

