Hinase Hotaru

22:48.840 --> 22:59.600
Good morning, Hananoi-kun!

22:50.340 --> 22:59.600
I got so excited yesterday, I couldn't sleep at all

22:53.850 --> 22:59.600
Same

22:56.850 --> 22:59.600
Hinase Hotaru

22:56.850 --> 22:59.600
I turn so red when I remember we're in love

22:59.600 --> 23:02.860
Hinase Hotaru

22:59.600 --> 23:02.860
Starting today, I'm your girlfriend!

23:02.840 --> 23:07.600
<i>Hananoi-kun, I'm... in love with you!</i>

23:13.970 --> 23:15.300
<i>What am I gonna do?</i>

23:16.570 --> 23:18.110
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

